UPDATE companies SET description='Castillo Electric Distribution was founded in 2006 in Signal Hill, California, as an electrician-run wholesale electrical supplier.

The company stocks and distributes a broad line of electrical products including switchgear, circuit breakers, panelboards, fuses, wiring, conduit, lighting, controls, tools, and safety gear. As an official Siemens distributor, it sources from major manufacturers and backs sales with consulting services such as project planning, material sourcing, logistics coordination, and product selection guidance. A recurring-supplies program and the Castillo EDGE loyalty tier offer volume pricing and flexible fulfillment for ongoing accounts.

Customers span residential, commercial, and industrial construction, as well as facility maintenance and property management.

Castillo Electric Distribution differentiates itself through trade-driven expertise—its staff includes seasoned electricians who provide hands-on recommendations—and a commitment to complete, on-time orders that prevent costly job-site delays. Transparent pricing, a no-upsell approach, and the Castillo EDGE rewards program are cited as core value drivers for repeat buyers.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wholesale electrical distribution", "Project consultation", "Material sourcing", "Logistics support", "Product guidance", "Recurring supplies program", "Fast shipping", "Local pickup", "Switchgear and component supply", "Lighting and controls supply", "Wiring and conduit supply", "Tools and safety gear supply"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Industrial construction", "Facility maintenance", "Electrical contracting", "Property management"], "materials": ["Switchgear", "Circuit breakers", "Panelboards", "Fuses", "Wiring", "Conduit", "Lighting", "Controls", "Tools", "Safety equipment"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Official Siemens Distributor", "Electrician-run business with field-experienced staff", "Castillo EDGE loyalty program with volume discounts and flexible terms", "Fast shipping and local pickup nationwide", "Project consultation, material sourcing, and logistics support"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2006 -> db", "Headquarters Signal Hill, California -> db", "Electrician-run business -> / page: ''An Electrician Run Business'', ''Run by an Electrician''", "Official Siemens Distributor -> / page: ''Official Siemens Distributor''", "Wholesale electrical distributor -> / page: ''Wholesale Electrical Supply'', ''The Professionals in wholesale electrical supplies''", "Partners with Mario Castillo Electric for installation/contracting -> /, /about-us, /services pages", "Offers consulting services, project consultation, material sourcing, logistics s