UPDATE companies SET description='Central Florida Sheet Metal, LLC operates from Cocoa, Florida, serving Brevard County and the East Coast of Florida. The company was established to provide HVAC sheet metal fabrication services, though a specific founding year and founder names are not publicly disclosed.

