UPDATE companies SET description='Scissor Tail Electric operates from Oklahoma City, Oklahoma, as a 100% family-owned electrical contractor. The company traces its roots to founder Dustin, who entered the trade through a high-school summer job with a home builder. After nearly three decades in the field, Dustin and his partners formed Scissor Tail Electric to serve the Central Oklahoma community they call home. Dustin remains personally involved in every project.

The firm provides a range of electrical services including switch and outlet installation and repair, ceiling fan installation, electrical panel upgrades, wiring and rewiring, lighting repair and upgrades, and washer and dryer hookups. Its licensed electricians handle residential, commercial, and industrial work, from single-family homes to complex industrial systems. The team, led by lead technician Fernando, emphasizes fast response and tailored solutions for each job.

Scissor Tail Electric serves homeowners, business owners, and industrial facilities across Central Oklahoma. The company states it works with clients from "cozy homes to buzzing businesses and booming factories."

