UPDATE companies SET description='Champion Steel Works, operating in Wilmington, Ohio, traces its roots to 1872 when it began as Champion Bridge Company. The family-led business has been passed down through generations; current president Noah Dell succeeded his father, continuing a legacy of serving the community with integrity and gratitude.

