UPDATE companies SET description='Charter Medical LLC operates from Winston-Salem, North Carolina. The company has nearly 35 years of experience developing single-use products for life sciences, though a founding year is not disclosed. It operates as part of the Solesis family of companies alongside sister firms Polyzen, Secant Group, and SanaVita Medical.

