UPDATE companies SET description='Chilton Furniture traces its roots to 1885 when Chilton Manufacturing Co. was established in Portland, Maine, producing paints, varnishes, and industrial coatings. The business was acquired by the Martens family in 1936, shifting focus to stains and finishes for furniture makers. In 2014, the Levin family took ownership, refocusing the company on exclusive furniture designs crafted from domestically sourced North American hardwoods. Today, it operates as a family-owned brand headquartered in Portland, with a flagship showroom there and a second location in Freeport.

The company designs contemporary, functional furniture—including seating, tables, storage, beds, and accessories—and collaborates with a network of independent makers in Maine and the Midwest to handcraft each piece from premium domestic hardwoods such as cherry, maple, walnut, and white oak. All materials are sourced in the United States. Chilton provides nationwide delivery and backs its products with a lifetime warranty for the original owner.

Chilton serves both direct consumers and trade professionals, including interior designers and retailers, through a trade partner program that offers discounts and benefits. Its furniture is marketed for residential use, with collections such as Shaker, Hudson, and Maine Made appealing to customers seeking handcrafted, domestically produced pieces.

The brand emphasizes its commitment to enduring craftsmanship, domestic sourcing, and New England design heritage. The lifetime warranty reflects confidence in the durability of its furniture, while the maker-partnership model aims to sustain regional woodworking traditions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Furniture design", "Handcrafted hardwood furniture manufacturing", "Domestic hardwood sourcing", "Nationwide delivery", "Trade partner program", "Lifetime warranty"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Interior design trade", "Home furnishings"], "materials": ["Cherry", "Maple", "Walnut", "White oak"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Lifetime warranty on all hardwood furniture", "Nationwide delivery service", "Handcrafted by independent makers in Maine and the Midwest", "Exclusive designs in domestically sourced cherry, maple, walnut, and white oak", "Family-owned since 2014 with roots dating to 1885"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1885 as Chilton Manufacturing Co. in Portland, Maine -> db, /about", "Acquired by Martens family 1936 -> /about", "Acquired by Levin family 2014 -> /about", "Family-owned brand -> /about", "Headquarters Portland, Maine -> db, /about", "Partners with independent makers in Maine and Midwest -> /about", "Lifetime warranty for original owner -> /about", "Nationwide delivery -> /about, /", "Domestically sourced hardwoods: cherry, maple, walnut, white oak -> /about", "Trade partner program with discounts -> /", "Handmade in USA -> /", "Showrooms in Portland and Freeport -> /", "Originally produced paints, varnishes, industrial coatings -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "unclear", "type_evidence": "We are a family-owned furniture brand that partners with a community of independent makers from Maine and the Midwest to bring our designs to life.", "founded_year": "1885", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compl