ision: lead industry with quality products, services & innovative solutions -> /about", "Mission: provide safe electrical equipment & create sustainable supply chain -> /about", "Fair pricing, no hidden fees -> /about", "Fast shipping -> /about", "Nationwide service -> /about", "15+ years of experience mentioned -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Circuit Breaker Buyers: Where to Sell New, Used & Surplus Circuit Breakers", "founded_year": "2015", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='circuit-breaker-source-circuit-breaker-buyers' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Circuit Design Specialties operates from Plano, Texas, as a woman-owned business founded by Randel Stewart, who serves as CEO. The company marks over three decades in the electronics industry, with Stewart bringing more than 33 years of experience to the operation.

The firm provides complete electronic and mechanical assembly services from its own manufacturing facility. Its capabilities span PCB layout—including high-layer-count, blind and buried vias, flex, rigid-flex, mixed-material, and high-speed impedance-controlled designs—PCB manufacturing, PCB assembly, cable and wiring harness assembly, and full box-build integration. An in-house engineering team handles new product development from concept through prototype to production, leveraging the manufacturing side to design for testability and cost reduction.

