UPDATE companies SET description='Clovis Steel LLC was founded in 1999 in Clovis, New Mexico, initially as a steel retailer. The company has since expanded into a full-service building center with a second location in Canyon, Texas.

The company supplies structural steel, sheet metal, and a broad range of building materials including plumbing, fencing, concrete, garage doors, and welding supplies. It also designs and fabricates custom metal buildings—offering bolt-up, cold-formed, and weld-up systems—and provides engineering support such as stamped foundation drawings and building take-offs.

Customers include contractors, engineers, agricultural operators, and residential builders across the construction, agriculture, and commercial building sectors. The firm’s building packages have been used for projects ranging from small storage structures to large commercial facilities, and its materials meet ASTM standards for fencing and other applications.

