UPDATE companies SET description='Comfort Foods Co-packing & Processing operates from a 44,000-square-foot facility in Albuquerque, New Mexico. The company has been in business for over 30 years, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed.

The operation provides custom blending, packaging, and co-packing services for both wet and dry food products. Its lines handle package sizes ranging from less than half an ounce up to 50-pound bulk containers. Wet capabilities include salsas, barbecue sauces, jellies, salad dressings, and condiments; dry capabilities cover seasoning blends, soup mixes, bread mixes, dip mixes, and dessert mixes. Packaging formats span bulk, plastic and glass bottles, pouches and packets, portion cups, and cartons. The company also offers custom formulation and private-label manufacturing.

The firm works with clients who bring their own formulations, request proprietary development, or select from the company''s house recipes. Its membership in the Contract Manufacturers Association underscores a focus on business-to-business co-packing relationships.

Quality assurance is a stated differentiator: the facility maintains SQF certification with a Costco addendum, HACCP plans, a dedicated allergen program, FDA compliance, kosher certification, metal detection, and sample retention. A full-time quality control staff enforces specifications and good manufacturing practices.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF with Costco addendum','HACCP','Kosher','FDA compliance','GMP']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom blending", "Custom packaging", "Co-packing", "Custom formulation", "Private label manufacturing", "Wet product manufacturing (salsas, BBQ sauce, jellies, salad dressings, condiments)", "Dry product manufacturing (seasoning blends, soup mixes, bread mixes, dip mixes, dessert mixes)", "Packaging: bulk, plastic bottles, glass bottles, pouches, packets, portion cups, cartons", "Quality assurance (SQF, HACCP, allergen program, FDA compliance, recall program, sample retention, metal detection, GMP)", "Kosher certification"], "industries": ["Food contract manufacturing", "Private label food production", "Condiment and sauce manufacturing", "Seasoning and dry blend manufacturing", "Co-packing services"], "materials": ["Food ingredients (spices, sauces, flours, sugars, etc.)", "Plastic packaging", "Glass packaging", "Flexible pouch films", "Cartonboard", "Bulk containers"], "equipment": ["Blending lines", "Packaging lines", "Metal detector"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["SQF certification with Costco addendum", "44,000 sq ft facility with both wet and dry production lines", "Packaging range from sub-ounce to 50-lb bulk", "Full-time QC staff with metal detection and allergen controls", "Kosher certified and member of Contract Manufacturers Association"], "facts_used": ["Location: Albuquerque, NM -> db", "Facility size: 44,000 sq ft -> /", "Years in business: over 30 years -> /", "Services: custom blending, packaging, co-packing, formulation, private label -> /", "Wet products: salsas, BBQ sauc