UPDATE companies SET description='Commercial Packaging was founded in 1983 by Gary and Janette Egbers in Bloomington, Illinois. After Gary’s passing in 2004, Janette Egbers continued as chairwoman, president, and CEO, and the company remains family-owned and operated from its Central Illinois headquarters.

