UPDATE companies SET description='Commonwealth Solar operates from Wilmore, Kentucky, where it has built a reputation as a dedicated solar installer serving both commercial and residential customers. While the company does not publicly disclose its founding year or ownership structure, it positions itself as a locally focused enterprise committed to creating Kentucky jobs and keeping installation crews in-house rather than relying on subcontractors.

